  "termsDrivingBody": "You remain responsible for driving safely and following local laws. Do not operate the app while driving. If you feel drowsy, park somewhere safe and rest. We accept no liability for accidents or damage caused by relying on this app.",
  "privacyTitle": "Privacy",
  "termsPrivacyBody": "Camera and breathing detection run on your device without saving recordings (the only recording is the dashcam you open yourself, saved on this device). In car mode, speed limit alerts (on by default) send the rough area you're in, a square about 2 km across, to an OpenStreetMap map server. Optional voice control uses your device’s speech recognition service, which may send audio to its provider. Advertising and purchase services also use network connections.",
  "termsAsIsTitle": "Provided as is",
  "termsAsIsBody": "Accuracy and continued availability are not guaranteed. Purchases and refunds follow Google Play’s rules.",
