  "walkLightBody": "Blinks the rear light twice a second so drivers can spot you. Unlike a reflector, it doesn't need their headlights to hit you, so it shows from the side and at angles too. Point the light toward the road and wear the phone in a chest pocket or on a strap. Don't walk while looking at the screen.",
